+
+| Invocation | Selected claims | Exit | Result |
+|---|---|---:|---|
+| 1 | `SPEC.find-load`, `SPEC.find-init` | 0 | `#Top` |
+| 2 | three `poly-loop-*` claims | 0 | `#Top` |
